        "slc_7cbd391e9603a352eb146765684982d888fe2d4eddea28c74c5f7108a817164f"
      ],
      "text": "Each agent works in an isolated git worktree on its own branch, and code reaches main only after explicit user approval through a mandatory review step in the task state machine."
    },
