        "slc_62ea80c4d3eb0529da85a34650c89d6ca04e3f33a30ef48a00b0806d25b73d6a"
      ],
      "text": "`orch serve` runs a headless daemon with a tick loop that picks up newly added tasks; a `--once` mode processes todo tasks and exits, with exit 0 meaning all done and exit 1 indicating failures."
    },
